(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->171623919,ExpressionUUID->"6d4b35a1-5eba-e261-3545-ed30b96cf6d0"],

Cell["Continuous Quantum Measurement in the Wolfram Language", "Title",
 CellID->1606804240,ExpressionUUID->"35b09861-2830-44c3-2166-ea2cc5ad00e8"],

Cell["A watched quantum system, one problem per slide", "Subtitle",
 CellID->1787170966,ExpressionUUID->"6aa34e1c-8bd0-3ee0-6217-faf3bf036b71"],

Cell["Mads Bahrami, Wolfram Research, Nov 2026", "Subsubtitle",
 CellID->1617143183,ExpressionUUID->"463c6386-2b69-8d0c-1a8e-0db8954265a0"],

Cell["quantum@wolfram.com", "Subsubtitle",
 CellID->1175228907,ExpressionUUID->"08d0737f-2a48-82f5-66f1-f72f788347ab"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->1304387619,ExpressionUUID->"0ebe674e-8808-3928-54ad-5d276f25552b"],

Cell["How the Wolfram Language handles a watched quantum system", "Subsection",
 CellID->574432246,ExpressionUUID->"6bb0ff29-7a4c-f121-6abc-747823fdc722"],

Cell["\<\
Every slide poses one physical question, writes the model as an equation, and \
lets the language either solve it exactly or sample it, with the closed form \
and the simulation checked against each other. A few ideas recur:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->633444251,ExpressionUUID->"57ac0905-17cb-d594-7b26-21f4df370fa9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Write the stochastic master equation once.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The conditioned Bloch-vector equations become one ",
 Cell[BoxData["ItoProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "043c6a49-2c40-6804-2a31-24712ddfa8b2"],
 ", and every step reuses it. ",
 Cell[BoxData["RandomFunction"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5cbaa588-6144-da35-66b9-e0fd0c5c367c"],
 " samples quantum trajectories. The ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Derivative\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "042d8526-542b-2564-4f69-b4838dee78e9"],
 " property applies It\[OHat]'s lemma: for the purity ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "47cb90dd-6142-a18e-5e92-ac3b622d625c"],
 " it shows whether watching purifies the state and whether a trajectory can \
leave the Bloch ball, and for the log-likelihood ratio ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["arctanh",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "37b592a8-6a8e-790b-3396-990789286d60"],
 " it shows when the integrated readout alone fixes the population. ",
 Cell[BoxData["StratonovichProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30cf53e1-f393-d878-6f80-784a7d41cbc1"],
 " gives the Stratonovich form, which ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56995dc1-470e-9e77-7d85-62f13fbca634"],
 " integrates along a smooth noise path."
}], "Item",
 CellID->2094125215,ExpressionUUID->"5c22c29d-aac8-8f8c-56e4-b5748eb3a543"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The average over records is a Lindblad equation in \
QuantumFramework.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Liouvillian\>\"", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "jumps", ",", " ", "rates"}], "]"}], "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20991ed6-8dbb-80cb-25cb-af92b3f67f1d"],
 " gives the superoperator as a matrix, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["QuantumEvolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7e17f7fb-ccf4-77a7-4831-e238c364207b"],
 " with jump operators and rates evolves the averaged state. This average is \
the reference line the single runs are drawn against."
}], "Item",
 CellID->44134596,ExpressionUUID->"263e1f2c-fb2c-f982-5d72-d96c97d1322e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Exact statements come from the Liouvillian matrix.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData["Discriminant"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46252257-b0f5-c4ed-644c-249c331dd400"],
 " of its ",
 Cell[BoxData["CharacteristicPolynomial"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "60836150-e167-22fe-3618-eb959ed55545"],
 " locates exceptional points. ",
 Cell[BoxData["Reduce"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c805f55-2ffd-dd4a-5708-fdd11c577972"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData["Exists"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "41f7b98d-6461-d82c-0bba-b84963e3b46d"],
 " turns \"is there a measurement strength where\[Ellipsis]\" into a \
condition on the parameters. ",
 Cell[BoxData["NullSpace"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11ab515c-f195-1c0f-4426-e281f13e40fe"],
 " gives the steady state, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["LinearSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7b4cb57b-ba00-092b-6d68-96013a28a784"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "-", "\[ScriptCapitalL]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0864dc68-9a9a-2eb9-47fb-ce670b935f74"],
 " gives the detector's noise spectrum in closed form."
}], "Item",
 CellID->1307007571,ExpressionUUID->"1ec206f2-09f1-1d01-204f-7beb3545c53b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A filter is a fold over the record.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Each reading is drawn with ",
 Cell[BoxData["RandomVariate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58581d72-c99f-7674-7eed-ce22c2282488"],
 " from Born's probabilities blurred by detector noise, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["FoldList"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11bc2bfc-81bf-a42e-2bcd-22d87248303b"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData["NestList"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10cf7f15-0834-2ba0-715f-1ced26ab7dfb"],
 " applies Bayes' rule to whatever the filter keeps: two amplitudes, a \
density matrix, five Gaussian moments or four syndrome probabilities. The \
same readings drive a full-state simulation, so the filter can be checked \
against it."
}], "Item",
 CellID->525944366,ExpressionUUID->"53628cd7-bbb3-b200-2d7b-8e69c7073564"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Operator algebra replaces matrices where it can.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData["NonCommutativeAlgebra"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "598336ec-1f33-0025-7495-d36520478711"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData["NonCommutativeExpand"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d4daab5-75de-aba9-5649-cf094f07972b"],
 " derives the moment equations of a watched Gaussian from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["p", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[HBar]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "05551317-1ef8-9ce7-0bcc-2ecc68283667"],
 ", and the syndrome equation of a watched code from the Pauli relations, \
with ",
 Cell[BoxData["SolveAlways"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d10e1fe-8299-2300-54dd-839647c9731e"],
 " matching coefficients for a general state. The Riccati equations for the \
widths are then solved symbolically, with ",
 Cell[BoxData["Resolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166f0566-c1f1-f7e4-092f-82ed71a5f353"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["ForAll"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1a87c268-a8ce-79bd-25b5-580db22edbfa"],
 " picking the physical root."
}], "Item",
 CellID->56923714,ExpressionUUID->"0620a49f-088c-026a-2941-f2f410851c0c"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->1498948129,ExpressionUUID->"4c38b132-407a-59aa-59e6-21cdb0afac2e"],

Cell["A driven qubit under continuous measurement", "Subsection",
 CellID->1393935745,ExpressionUUID->"5e16f1cd-19cd-b1dd-20e3-8b41202209da"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A qubit is driven with Rabi frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3084a9a7-c082-9f50-4d75-b9ad7786be95"],
 ", detuned by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalDelta]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c9c6d77-e524-3b90-2e52-7435927c9581"],
 " from its transition, while a detector continuously measures ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "075fa20c-87f4-981d-535c-8cc0430d3fc7"],
 " at strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "01478ae7-1e13-89cb-2f92-758a6b192698"],
 " and catches a fraction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4416b512-4887-b304-37ee-63a1ef6ae158"],
 " of the signal. Does watching stop the oscillation?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->313917289,ExpressionUUID->"602bec11-d739-7372-293e-79500ca8092e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2612c84a-0155-f77b-4002-84d84b7fafaa"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{"0"},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{"0"},
      "Bra"]}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{"1"},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{"1"},
      "Bra"]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4a364f71-f913-e67b-3ca8-4db33e4a448d"],
 ", the driven qubit in the frame rotating at the drive frequency is"
}], "Text",
 CellID->451134304,ExpressionUUID->"592aa7c2-bd88-a161-09e3-6f65f656eb71"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
    FractionBox[
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "+", "\[CapitalOmega]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "\[ThickSpace]", "\[LongRightArrow]", 
    "\[ThickSpace]", 
    FractionBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "+", 
    FractionBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "=", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["q", "TI"]], "-", 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->844157360,ExpressionUUID->"0f193539-a824-d95b-75e6-64eea0a73392"],

Cell["\<\
and the state conditioned on the detector record obeys the It\[OHat] \
stochastic master equation\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1463381688,ExpressionUUID->"4f1a0760-88d8-53f0-0ca5-7f933cf971d3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
    SqrtBox[
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "k"}], "TI"]], "(", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "-", "2", 
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], ")", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->10151855,ExpressionUUID->"49b4a1fc-b1dc-05a6-677c-fdfebaa8dfe2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Its average over records, without the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "616f94af-e2aa-f291-6179-349920126942"],
 " term, is the Lindblad equation. For the Bloch vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["y", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
     StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
      SpanMaxSize->1]}]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51e72314-6dd6-cfe6-18de-96aeab6a43a9"],
 " it reads"
}], "Text",
 CellID->905391953,ExpressionUUID->"502f453a-dc39-6e6f-37d6-08f0987a583f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[GridBox[{
    {
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"d", "x"}], "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       RowBox[{"-", "2", 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], "-", "\[CapitalDelta]", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"]}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "2", 
       SqrtBox[
        StyleBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "k"}], "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], ","}]},
    {
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"d", "y"}], "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], "-", "2", 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], "-", "\[CapitalOmega]", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "2", 
       SqrtBox[
        StyleBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "k"}], "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], ","}]},
    {
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"d", "z"}], "TI"], 
     RowBox[{"=", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", 
       StyleBox["y", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "2", 
       SqrtBox[
        StyleBox[
         RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "k"}], "TI"]], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       RowBox[{"1", "-", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1], "\[ThinSpace]", 
       StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}]}
   },
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {Right, {Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->430045044,ExpressionUUID->"323cb63d-6ef8-3e89-3933-6861221f87ac"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Three runs start from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{"0"},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "440c7fc0-cd6d-ce8c-55a5-35094f574156"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "45af5c39-d746-32a0-6888-bd5d3249d1e1"],
 "), sampled with a step that shrinks as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4cd55275-352d-b42b-2807-1513b7b12c47"],
 " grows, against the Lindblad average (red, dashed); each run plots ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67f17767-a12d-36cb-1f52-d2c8b4afd427"],
 " conditioned on its own record, and rates are in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4fbe7708-eab8-ce16-6e2f-ae6d332b3838"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->234837243,ExpressionUUID->"71104ab2-abaa-aacc-34c0-edbeec463974"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"measuredQubitSME", "[", 
    RowBox[{"k_", ",", " ", "\[Eta]_", ",", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]_"}], "]"}], 
   " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ItoProcess", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", "k", " ", 
           RowBox[{"x", "[", "t", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", 
           RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", 
           RowBox[{"x", "[", "t", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", "k", " ", 
           RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "k"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"x", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "k"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"y", "[", "t", "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\[Eta]", " ", "k"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"z", "[", "t", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], "}"}]}], 
        "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"measuredQubitAverage", "[", 
    RowBox[{"k_", ",", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Re", " ", "@", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"QuantumEvolve", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "/", "2"}], " ", 
            RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<Z\>\"", "]"}]}], " ", "+", 
           " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<X\>\"", "]"}], "/", "2"}]}], 
          ",", "\n", "    ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<Z\>\"", "]"}], "}"}], " ", "->",
            " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", "k", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"QuantumState", "[", "\"\<0\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "30"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
        "[", "\"\<DensityMatrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
      RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "3", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"measuredQubitPanel", "[", 
    RowBox[{"k_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\[Eta]_", ",", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
   ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Show", "[", "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ListLinePlot", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"#", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{";;", " ", ";;", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
             RowBox[{"0.01", "/", 
              RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0.01", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"0.005", "/", "k"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}],
          " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"RandomFunction", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"measuredQubitSME", "[", 
             RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "\[Eta]", ",", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]"}], 
             "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "30.", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
               RowBox[{"0.01", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"0.005", "/", "k"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "3", 
            ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
            "Method", " ", "->", 
             " ", "\"\<StochasticRungeKuttaScalarNoise\>\""}]}], "]"}], "[", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<PathComponent\>\"", ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], 
         "[", "\"\<Paths\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "    ", 
     RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
        RowBox[{"measuredQubitAverage", "[", 
         RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "30"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Red", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "    ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<\[CapitalOmega] t\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<\[LeftAngleBracket]\>\"", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<\[Sigma]\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
           " ", "\"\<\[RightAngleBracket]\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",",
      "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{"Epilog", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Inset", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<\[Eta] = \>\"", ",", " ", "\[Eta]"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{"Scaled", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0.96", ",", " ", "0.96"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"Right", ",", " ", "Top"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "300"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"measuredQubitPanels", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "1", "]"}], ";", " ", 
     RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
        RowBox[{"kd", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"measuredQubitPanel", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"First", "[", "kd", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Last", "[", "kd", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}],
           " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0.3", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
           "0.1", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", 
            "10"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
           "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"measuredQubitLesson", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
     "0.1", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<Runs oscillate; the average decays only because they fall out \
of phase.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
     "0.5", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<Runs still oscillate, kicked irregularly by the \
record.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
     "1", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<Crossover: oscillation stops and runs linger near the \
poles.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
     "5", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<Zeno: runs stick at a pole and jump; the average only decays.\
\>\""}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
     "10", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Stronger watching, rarer jumps.\>\""}]}], 
    "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Manipulate", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Legended", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"PlotGrid", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"measuredQubitPanels", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}], "]"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "800"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Placed", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"LineLegend", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", "97", "]"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Range", "[", "3", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Red", ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<run 1\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<run 2\>\"", ",", 
           " ", "\"\<run 3\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Lindblad average\>\""}], 
          "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"LegendLayout", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Row\>\""}]}], "]"}], ",",
        " ", "Below"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Control", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
             "k", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", 
              " ", "\"\<measurement strength k/\[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], "}"}], 
            ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
             "0.1", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "5", ",", " ", 
              "10"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "SetterBar"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"Control", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
             "d", ",", " ", "0", ",", 
              " ", "\"\<detuning \[CapitalDelta]/\[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], 
             "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0.5", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "2"}], 
             "}"}], ",", " ", "SetterBar"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
       "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"Spacer", "[", "20", "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", "\n", "      ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<k/\[CapitalOmega] = \>\"", ",", " ", "k"}], 
                 "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Bold", ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}], ",",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"measuredQubitLesson", "[", "k", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
           "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
              
              RowBox[{"\"\<\[Eta] < 1\>\"", ",", " ", "Bold", ",", " ", 
               "12"}], "]"}], ",", 
             " ", "\"\<Runs stay mixed and miss the poles.\>\""}], "}"}], ",",
            "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
              
              RowBox[{"\"\<\[CapitalDelta] \[NotEqual] 0\>\"", ",", " ", 
               "Bold", ",", " ", "12"}], "]"}], ",", 
             " ", "\"\<Weak watching only: smaller swing, slow drift between \
poles.\>\""}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"Left", ",", " ", "Top"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ItemSize", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"6", ",", " ", "44"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Spacings", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "0.6"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"BaseStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"12", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"LineIndent", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], 
       "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"SaveDefinitions", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->199760013,ExpressionUUID->"50636079-68fb-9748-30fd-cccbfafa3cc3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "/", "\[CapitalOmega]", "=", "0.1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29403e3c-2495-a7bb-1a79-ec4178705cab"],
 " the runs keep Rabi-oscillating. At ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "/", "\[CapitalOmega]", "=", "10"}]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7f3576f9-71c3-85f7-516e-436c53bf0d50"],
 " they stay pinned near ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ce0c850-4146-4e30-7aa7-5f10cbda20a0"],
 ", with brief spikes that fall back and now and then a full jump to the \
other pole: that is the quantum Zeno effect, which the average shows only as \
a slow decay. A detector that catches less of the signal leaves each run \
mixed, so under weak measurement its oscillation no longer reaches the poles. \
Detuning shrinks the Rabi swing to a fast wiggle near the starting pole, and \
under weak watching the record then carries the runs slowly from pole to \
pole; once the measurement is much stronger than the detuning, the runs look \
as they do on resonance."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1072894386,ExpressionUUID->"170c367e-0186-4080-053f-8d2a2228f011"],

Cell["\[NonBreakingSpace]", "SlideShowNavigationBar",
 CellTags->"SlideShowHeader",
 CellID->1333411129,ExpressionUUID->"17ba67d1-5fc5-da1c-367a-848b49b3eebc"],

Cell["The quantum Zeno crossover as an exceptional point", "Subsection",
 CellID->1825142838,ExpressionUUID->"421c5cb9-2fe1-10c9-4576-0f1651bbc0b6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A qubit is driven with Rabi frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0ec887f1-8bc1-2035-466f-6cc9ad0d78b5"],
 ", detuned by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalDelta]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12ac60b9-2693-1844-7902-9458a423ecb6"],
 " from the drive, while a detector measures ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65ed1f94-be77-8198-68ae-b23dc06bc9c7"],
 " at strength ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "766382b8-c8c0-c739-4efc-ab62c7207699"],
 ". Weak watching damps the Rabi oscillation and strong watching freezes it; \
what happens to the dynamics at the crossover?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->990404510,ExpressionUUID->"2f033ec3-9a32-909c-7083-40bd441fab38"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c2e91a3-1004-1d59-32b8-0e95b9cbf3c2"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{"0"},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "413685d9-cca4-06f3-4f3d-d07f8d6f13d0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{"1"},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3c4bc79e-9a49-fd7c-615d-0438c5ff52c7"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["e", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["g", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7172b8f9-1645-2a83-65bb-3e5a2ff869bc"],
 ", qubit frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c04ef03-8d8d-7f96-54d7-8e253b60fb66"],
 " and drive frequency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Omega]", "TI"], "-", "\[CapitalDelta]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "62a820d1-5e34-b13b-3a5d-e506777c57f2"],
 ", the Hamiltonian in the frame rotating with the drive is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox["\[CapitalDelta]", "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "+", 
   FractionBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "32eb19c8-7f54-8555-1b3c-d2d57a5045e1"],
 ", and averaging over the detector record gives"
}], "Text",
 CellID->977444660,ExpressionUUID->"7237ffa2-e5c6-34f2-5768-e88253bbb929"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", "\[ScriptCapitalL]", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1245419701,ExpressionUUID->"68f1c271-bb45-23e6-4bc4-30cadad953d2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Away from exceptional points, every solution is a sum of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", "t"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "609a486f-563c-a7d4-0bbb-6ff914b5d74b"],
 " over the eigenvalues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "384bc1c8-7cd3-e104-73ac-be13856d296d"],
 " of the superoperator ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d09eda0-2225-eefc-0523-4e6e47ecc51e"],
 ". At an exceptional point two eigenvalues and their eigenvectors coincide, \
so ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e5f148d-142a-1c87-2fed-83741d372738"],
 " cannot be diagonalized; there the discriminant of its characteristic \
polynomial, with the steady state's root ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1996ec9a-a45d-c0b1-6f7d-ecf577ffd9ba"],
 " divided out, vanishes."
}], "Text",
 CellID->365704094,ExpressionUUID->"02d9412e-128c-3f57-4f36-b6ff82a4b653"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On resonance the Rabi pair solves ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "2"], "+", "2", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d52046e-aa08-2c10-7b01-8207607f295b"],
 ", so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[PlusMinus]", 
   SqrtBox[
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["k", "TI"], "2"], "-", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"]}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d3eff4d-962c-39a7-142e-0f1e904a97d4"],
 ": a damped oscillation for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "<", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "302e0d1a-396c-30f4-361b-c7db92962f49"],
 ", and for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], ">", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "265b0132-b686-cd53-5801-8270aac48673"],
 " two real rates, one of which, about ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1afd75b6-4bbe-cb70-6815-da1f95e05293"],
 ", slows as the watching grows stronger, the Zeno effect. The two meet at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0b09dcd0-48b4-367d-664b-064881127a66"],
 ". The discriminant of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e10a14e-4bb8-dcb2-75f0-a01d1784629a"],
 "'s characteristic polynomial, with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"], "=", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7a51875e-82a1-1afd-128f-db4ed6748038"],
 " divided out, has a zero at some ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], ">", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "302f1efe-f38b-6119-34d5-493184a6e994"],
 ", an exceptional point, only for:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1750990038,ExpressionUUID->"6fd3e988-9251-7ef5-2f3f-3a8a99569e09"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"liouA5", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Liouvillian\>\"", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "/", "2"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<Z\>\"", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", "/", "2"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<X\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"QuantumOperator", "[", "\"\<Z\>\"", "]"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        
        RowBox[{"{", "k", "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", "\"\<Matrix\>\"", "]"}],
     "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"discA5", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Discriminant", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Cancel", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"CharacteristicPolynomial", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"liouA5", " ", "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", "->", " ", "1"}]}], ",", " ", 
         "\[Lambda]"}], "]"}], "/", "\[Lambda]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     "\[Lambda]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Reduce", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exists", "[", 
      RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"k", " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
        RowBox[{"discA5", " ", "==", " ", "0"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     "\[CapitalDelta]", ",", " ", "Reals"}], "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"HoldForm", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "/", "\[CapitalOmega]"}], "]"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",
 CellID->84727264,ExpressionUUID->"13c50911-dabf-e503-284f-642dd8d759d9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The top row lets ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "49803dd5-17c8-783c-147e-e36c46dd18f7"],
 " be complex, so each exceptional point becomes an isolated zero of the \
discriminant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "01f0bd29-2a33-e33a-4ff3-c6974cca5bee"],
 ", marked by a dot at the center of its rings of constant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["log",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", GridBox[{
     {
      StyleBox["D", "TI"]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d9ad4df-f045-62e1-1ecd-ade4fa0c2546"],
 ". The bottom row plots, on the same axis for real ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "142b6be3-68eb-8ce5-2f57-4989d160047d"],
 ", the qubit's relaxation rate, the smallest nonzero ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"-", 
   StyleBox["Re",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35a4e461-5c60-d855-0a5b-709cdddec45e"],
 " of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[ScriptCapitalL]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "476da040-ccec-38f3-0339-347eb14ea7f0"],
 ", and its oscillation frequency, the largest ",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["Im",
       FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
      StyleBox["\[Lambda]", "TI"]}]}
   },
   GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
   GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "23815da9-7b4b-7462-2dab-b8a707c45bcd"],
 "; dashed lines mark the real parts of the exceptional points, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1c35610a-bc62-6ef0-7695-79841c27df56"],
 " and rates are in units of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "16fc5fc2-664a-bb55-29b0-59cf839b1c51"],
 ":"
}], "Text",
 CellID->728999986,ExpressionUUID->"1362d513-07b5-d236-3f26-cfb374b2d250"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]sA5", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", "/", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"epA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ReIm", "[", 
      RowBox[{"k", " ", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"NSolve", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"discA5", " ", "/.", " ", 
            RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", "->", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]v"}]}],
            ")"}], " ", "==", " ", "0"}], ",", " ", "k"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"First", "[", "#", "]"}], " ", ">", " ", "0"}], " ", "&"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"markA5", "[", 
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"y0_", ",", " ", "y1_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"GrayLevel", "[", "0.4", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"AbsoluteThickness", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", "Dashed", ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "y0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "y1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], 
      " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Union", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"epA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v", "]"}], "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"10", "^", 
          RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"labelA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Inset", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Framed", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<\[CapitalDelta]/\[CapitalOmega] = \>\"", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v", " ", "===", " ", 
               RowBox[{"1", "/", 
                RowBox[{"(", 
                 RowBox[{"2", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<1/(2\>\"", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                 " ", "\"\<)\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v", "]"}], ",",
                 " ", 
                RowBox[{"FractionBoxOptions", " ", "->", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"Beveled", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], "}"}]}]}], 
               "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Black"}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Background", " ", "->", " ", "White"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"FrameStyle", " ", "->", " ", "None"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Scaled", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0.97", ",", " ", "0.97"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"Right", ",", " ", "Top"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"discPanelA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ComplexContourPlot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
        RowBox[{"discA5", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", "->", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]v"}], ",",
            " ", 
           RowBox[{"k", " ", "->", " ", "z"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}],
      ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"z", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"0.1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"0.7", " ", "I"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"1.7", " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"0.7", " ", "I"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Contours", " ", "->", " ", "20"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotPoints", " ", "->", " ", "60"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Epilog", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"GrayLevel", "[", "0.3", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"AbsoluteThickness", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Line", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"0.1", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1.7", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], 
        ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"markA5", "[", 
         RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "0.7"}], ",", " ", "0.7"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"White", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"PointSize", "[", "0.045", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Point", "[", 
           RowBox[{"epA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          "Black", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"PointSize", "[", "0.028", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Point", "[", 
           RowBox[{"epA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{"labelA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Re k/\[CapitalOmega]\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<Im k/\[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "230"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rateA5", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"kv_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", 
          RowBox[{"liouA5", " ", "/.", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", "->", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]v"}], 
             ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"k", " ", "->", " ", "kv"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
        "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"#", " ", ">", " ", 
        RowBox[{"10", "^", 
         RowBox[{"-", "9"}]}]}], " ", "&"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"freqA5", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"kv_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Im", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Eigenvalues", "[", 
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{"liouA5", " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", " ", "->", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]v"}], ",",
            " ", 
           RowBox[{"k", " ", "->", " ", "kv"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
      "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ratePanelA5", "[", "\[CapitalDelta]v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"rateA5", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v", ",", " ", "kk"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"freqA5", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v", ",", " ", "kk"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"kk", ",", " ", "0.1", ",", " ", "1.7"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotPoints", " ", "->", " ", "200"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "0.06"}], ",", " ", "1.5"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Epilog", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"markA5", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]v", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "0.06"}], ",", " ", "1.5"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"None", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"y", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"GrayLevel", "[", "0.8", "]"}], ",", " ", "Dashed"}], 
               "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"y", ",", " ", "0.2", ",", " ", "1.4", ",", " ", "0.2"}],
              "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
             RowBox[{"GrayLevel", "[", "0.4", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"AspectRatio", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<k/\[CapitalOmega]\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<rate / \[CapitalOmega]\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "230"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Labeled", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Legended", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"PlotGrid", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"discPanelA5", " ", "/@", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]sA5"}], 
            "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "900"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"PlotGrid", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"ratePanelA5", " ", "/@", " ", "\[CapitalDelta]sA5"}], 
            "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "900"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"Spacings", " ", "->", " ", "0"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Placed", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"LineLegend", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", "97", "]"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          
          RowBox[{"\"\<relaxation rate (slowest decay)\>\"", ",", 
           " ", "\"\<oscillation frequency\>\""}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"LegendLayout", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Row\>\"", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", " ",
        "Below"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
   "  ", "\"\<top: log|D(k)| for complex k, with D the discriminant of the \
Liouvillian's characteristic polynomial;  bottom: relaxation rate and \
oscillation frequency for real k\>\"", ",", " ", "Top"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",
 CellID->1180044206,ExpressionUUID->"67c70cb6-1b45-aa62-544f-1ed746e749a2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On resonance the slowest decay rate rises to a sharp peak at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["k", "TI"], "=", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14895ca5-73c6-2626-55c6-571f64c33380"],
 ", directly below the exceptional point: the qubit relaxes fastest there, \
critically damped between Rabi oscillation and the Zeno slowdown, whose rate \
falls as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "2"], "/", "2", 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04a83674-c538-d948-292c-8e5813da26bb"],
 ". A small detuning splits the exceptional point into two zeros on the real \
axis, one where the Rabi pair turns real and one where two real rates meet \
and turn complex again; at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "/", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "=", "1", "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "44389583-018c-c855-4a66-8cb65abd80d0"],
 " the two zeros merge, and for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "/", "\[CapitalOmega]"}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], ">", "1", "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SqrtBox["2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1052be48-b6ab-5c0f-5c42-c3f271ff7413"],
 " they leave the axis as a complex-conjugate pair, so no measurement \
strength reaches them, the Rabi pair never turns real, and the sharp peak of \
the decay rate becomes a smooth hump."
}], "Text",
 CellID->378596892,ExpressionUUID->"7e67c588-a37b-b49d-2635-8b9e7a17ce0c"],

