Cell["\<\
A charge qubit read by a point contact: when the Rabi peaks merge\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellID->1978785535,ExpressionUUID->"5629b47f-3231-2bdc-24c2-cc0340fe4d53"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "One electron tunnels between two quantum dots, left ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["L", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{"0"},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d8c64f7-b1f9-2f8e-540c-53e535e02115"],
 " and right ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["R", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "=", 
   TemplateBox[{"1"},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4994a442-5c78-28c3-76e9-1593c8132489"],
 ", with tunnelling ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[CapitalOmega]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3faebca9-451b-6822-02eb-51eda09a1c4d"],
 " and level offset ",
 Cell[BoxData["\[Epsilon]"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f14137f-52ff-5831-0c6f-67e0f67b2a9a"],
 ", while a nearby quantum point contact passes a current that depends on \
which dot is occupied. The current noise carries the fluctuations of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["L", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["L", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}], "-", 
    RowBox[{
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["R", "TI"]},
      "Ket"], 
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox["R", "TI"]},
      "Bra"]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "657fb2a2-3607-381b-44fe-507c732e18ab"],
 ". As the contact reads more strongly, do the Rabi peaks of that noise \
spectrum merge where the Liouvillian's eigenvectors coalesce?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2016628702,ExpressionUUID->"42f9a457-30d2-1f71-7175-093d7607898f"],

Cell[TextData[{
